----------------------------------
INSTALLATION INSTRUCTIONS
----------------------------------

Copy the following files in /etc/MailScanner/custom:

MailWatch.pm
MailWatchClient.pm
SQLAllowBlockList.pm
SQLSpamSettings.pm
MailWatchConf.pm

Set the API URL and key in MailWatchConf.pm. SQLAllowBlockList.pm and
SQLSpamSettings.pm use REST snapshots and no longer require database credentials
or a MariaDB Perl driver.

The API spool defaults to /var/spool/MailScanner/mailwatch. Its parent directory
must be writable by the MailScanner runtime user. MailWatch creates the spool
with mode 0700 and queued messages with mode 0600.
